(In Byzantine failures, the node exhibits random behavior like transmitting arbitrary messages) Tj
T*
(at arbitrary times, producing wrong results, or stopping midway. This mostly happens due to an) Tj
T*
(attack by a malicious entity or a software bug. A byzantine failure is the most challenging) Tj
T*
(type of failure to deal with.) Tj
T*
