T*
(# Design Considerations of a Blob Store) Tj
T*
(## Introduction) Tj
T*
(Even though we discussed the design of the blob store system and its major components in detail) Tj
T*
(in the previous lesson, a number of interesting questions still require answers. For example,) Tj
T*
(how do we store large blobs? Do we store them in the same disk, in the same machine, or do we) Tj
T*
(divide those blobs into chunks? How many replicas of a blob should be made to ensure) Tj
T*
(reliability and availability? How do we search for and retrieve blobs quickly?. These are just) Tj
T*
(some of the questions that might come up.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
