(```) Tj
T*
(                           Summary of the Lesson) Tj
T*
(Section                    Purpose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Blob metadata              This is the metadata that’s maintained to ensure efficient storage) Tj
T*
(and retrieval of blobs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Partitioning               This determines how blobs are partitioned among different data) Tj
T*
(nodes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Blob indexing              This shows us how to efficiently search for blobs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pagination                 This teaches us how to conceive a method for the retrieval of a) Tj
T*
(limited number of blobs to ensure improved readability and loading time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
