T*
(container_ID         Container -> list of blobs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Blob                             blob_ID                     {list of chunks,  chunkInfo: data) Tj
T*
(node ID's,.. }    blob_ID             Blob -> list of chunks) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
