T*
(# Evaluation of a Blob Store's Design) Tj
T*
(Let’s evaluate how our design helps us achieve our requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Availability) Tj
T*
(The replication part of our design makes the system available. For reading the data, we keep) Tj
T*
(four replicas for each blob. Having replicas, we can distribute the request load. If one node) Tj
T*
(fails, the other replica node can serve the request. Moreover, our replica placement strategy) Tj
T*
(handles a whole data center failure and can even handle the situation of region unavailability) Tj
T*
(due to natural disasters. We ensure that enough replicas are available at any point in time) Tj
T*
(using our monitoring service, which makes a copy of the data in a timely manner if the number) Tj
T*
(of failed replicas exceeds the specified threshold.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For write requests, we replicate the data within the cluster in a fault-tolerant way and) Tj
T*
