(## Building blocks we will use) Tj
T*
(We use the following building blocks in the design of our blob store system:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Building blocks for the design of a task scheduler]\(./bb.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Rate Limiter: A rate limiter is required to control the users’ interaction with the system.) Tj
T*
(- Load balancer: A load balancer is needed to distribute the request load onto different) Tj
T*
(servers.) Tj
T*
