(This means that later we can use them anywhere without having to go over them in detail again.) Tj
T*
(We can think about building blocks as bricks to construct more effective, capable systems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Many of the building blocks we discuss are also available for actual use in the public clouds,) Tj
T*
(such as Amazon Web Services \(AWS\), Azure, and Google Cloud Platform \(GCP\). We can use such) Tj
T*
(constructs to build a system to further cement our understanding. \(We won’t construct the) Tj
T*
(system in this course, but we’ve left it as an exercise for interested learners.\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
