(## Concluding the Building Blocks Discussion/The RESHADED Approach for System Design/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# The RESHADED Approach for System Design) Tj
T*
(## Introduction) Tj
T*
(System design problems are not straightforward. We don’t have a universal formula that we can) Tj
T*
(use for all design problems. However, we can use a high-level common strategy to set the tone) Tj
T*
(for a good solution to any design problem. We call this the RESHADED approach. Generally, all) Tj
T*
(our design problems are solved by keeping this strategy in mind. RESHADED is a guideline that) Tj
T*
(we’ll use to resolve different design problems. Although there’s no such thing as a one-size-) Tj
T*
(fits-all solution, using this approach will have its advantages, as we will see.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Breakdown of each letter in the RESHADED approach]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Advantages of RESHADED) Tj
T*
(Before we go through each word in RESHADED, let's cover the benefits of our overall approach.) Tj
T*
(Some of the key advantages of this approach are below:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. The RESHADED approach helps us remember some key steps for the resolution of every design) Tj
T*
(problem. This means that, at any point in time, there will always be a next step laid out ahead) Tj
T*
(of us.) Tj
T*
(2. The solution we come up with will have all the basic ingredients required to solve any) Tj
T*
(design problem. Not only that, but the solution offered through the RESHADED approach will be) Tj
T*
(systematic and thoughtful.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Exploring RESHADED) Tj
T*
(Below, we describe what steps we take under each word in RESHADED:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Requirements**: During this step, we gather all the requirements of the design problem and) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
