T*
(origin servers, and communicate to other components in the network. Let’s develop APIs for each) Tj
T*
(of the following functionalities:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Retrieve content) Tj
T*
(- Deliver content) Tj
T*
(- Request content) Tj
T*
(- Search content) Tj
T*
(- Update content) Tj
T*
(- Delete content) Tj
T*
ET
