(A secondary index is a way to efficiently access records in a database by means of some piece) Tj
T*
(of information other than the primary key.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A transaction is a single logical unit of work that accesses and possibly modifies the contents) Tj
T*
(of a database.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
