(#### Consistent hashing) Tj
T*
(Consistent hashing assigns each server or item in a distributed hash table a place on an) Tj
T*
(abstract circle, called a ring, irrespective of the number of servers in the table. This) Tj
T*
(permits servers and objects to scale without compromising the system’s overall performance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##### Advantages of consistent hashing) Tj
T*
(It’s easy to scale horizontally.) Tj
T*
(It increases the throughput and improves the latency of the application.) Tj
