T*
(with primary keys. But what if we have to access the records through secondary indexes?) Tj
T*
(Secondary indexes are the records that aren’t identified by primary keys but are just a way of) Tj
T*
(searching for some value. For example, the above illustration of horizontal partitioning) Tj
