(# Data Replication) Tj
T*
(Data is an asset for an organization because it drives the whole business. Data provides) Tj
T*
(critical business insights into what’s important and what needs to be changed. Organizations) Tj
T*
(also need to securely save and serve their clients’ data on demand. Timely access to the) Tj
T*
(required data under varying conditions \(increasing reads and writes, disks and node failures,) Tj
T*
(network and power outages, and so on\) is required to successfully run an online business.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(We need the following characteristics from our data store:) Tj
