(subqueries, which can be processed in a parallel fashion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#### Disadvantages) Tj
T*
(- Sometimes, data is required from multiple sites, which takes more time than expected.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Relations are partitioned vertically or horizontally among different nodes. Therefore,) Tj
T*
(operations such as joins need to reconstruct complete relations by carefully fetching data.) Tj
