T*
(- Consistency: At any given time, the database should be in a consistent state, and it should) Tj
T*
(remain in a consistent state after every transaction. For example, if multiple users want to) Tj
T*
(view a record from the database, it should return a similar result each time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
