() Tj
T*
(OT has two disadvantages:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Each operation to characters may require changes to the positional index. This means that) Tj
T*
(operations are order dependent on each other.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- It’s challenging to develop and implement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operational transformation is a set of complex algorithms, and its correct implementation has) Tj
T*
(proved challenging for real-world applications. For example, the Google Wave team took two) Tj
T*
(years to implement an OT algorithm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Conflict-free Replicated Data Type \(CRDT\)) Tj
T*
(The Conflict-free Replicated Data Type \(CRDT\) was developed in an effort to improve OT. A CRDT) Tj
T*
(has a complex data structure but a simplified algorithm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A CRDT satisfies both commutativity and idempotency by assigning two key properties to each) Tj
T*
(character:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- It assigns a globally unique identity to each character.) Tj
T*
(- It globally orders each character.) Tj
T*
(Each operation now has an updated data structure:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Simplified data structure of a CRDT]\(./crdt.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The SiteID uniquely identifies a user’s site requesting an operation with a Value and a) Tj
T*
(PositionalIndex. The value of PositionalIndex can be in fractions for two main reasons.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The PositionalIndex of other characters won’t change because of certain operations.) Tj
T*
(- The order dependency of operations between different users will be avoided.) Tj
T*
(The example below depicts that a user from site ID 123e4567-e89b-12d3 is inserting a character) Tj
T*
(with a value of A at a PositionalIndex of 1.5. Although a new character is added, the) Tj
T*
(positional indexes of existing characters are preserved using fractional indices. Therefore,) Tj
T*
(the order dependency between operations is avoided. As shown below, an insert\(\) between O and T) Tj
T*
(didn’t affect the position of T.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Preventing order dependency between operations]\(./prevention.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CRDTs ensure strong consistency between users. Even if some users are offline, the local) Tj
T*
(replicas at end users will converge when they come back online.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
