T*
(account creation, time of the last login, and so on.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Followers: This stores the relations of users. In Instagram, we have a unidirectional) Tj
T*
(relationship, for example, if user A accepts a follow request from user B, user B can view user) Tj
T*
