(## Design Instagram/Requirements of Instagram’s Design/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Requirements of Instagram’s Design) Tj
T*
(## Requirements) Tj
T*
(We’ll concentrate on some important features of Instagram to make this design simple. Let’s) Tj
T*
(list down the requirements for our system:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Functional requirements) Tj
T*
(- Post photos and videos: The users can post photos and videos on Instagram.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Follow and unfollow users: The users can follow and unfollow other users on Instagram.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Like or dislike posts: The users can like or dislike posts of the accounts they follow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Search photos and videos: The users can search photos and videos based on captions and) Tj
T*
(location.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Generate news feed: The users can view the news feed consisting of the photos and videos \(in) Tj
T*
(chronological order\) from all the users they follow. Users can also view suggested and promoted) Tj
T*
(photos in their news feed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Non-functional requirements) Tj
T*
(- Scalability: The system should be scalable to handle millions of users in terms of) Tj
T*
(computational resources and storage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Latency: The latency to generate a news feed should be low.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Availability: The system should be highly available.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Durability Any uploaded content \(photos and videos\) should never get lost.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Consistency: We can compromise a little on consistency. It is acceptable if the content) Tj
T*
(\(photos or videos\) takes time to show in followers’ feeds located in a distant region.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- eliability: The system must be able to tolerate hardware and software failures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Resource estimation) Tj
T*
(Our system is read-heavy because service users spend substantially more time browsing the feeds) Tj
T*
(of others than creating and posting new content. Our focus will be to design a system that can) Tj
T*
(fetch the photos and videos on time. There is no restriction on the number of photos or videos) Tj
T*
(that users can upload, meaning efficient storage management should be a primary consideration) Tj
T*
(in the design of this system. Instagram supports around a billion users globally who share 95) Tj
T*
(million photos and videos on Instagram per day. We’ll calculate the resources and design our) Tj
T*
(system based on the requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s assume the following:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
