() Tj
T*
(The storage per day will be:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(60 million photos/day * 3 MB = 180 TeraBytes / day) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(35 million videos/day * 150 MB = 5250 TB / day) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Total content size = 180 + 5250 = 5430 TB) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The total space required for a year:) Tj
