(## Design Newsfeed System/Design of a Newsfeed System/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Design of a Newsfeed System) Tj
T*
(Let’s discuss the high-level and detailed design of a newsfeed system based on the requirements) Tj
T*
(discussed in the previous lesson.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## High-level design of a newsfeed system) Tj
T*
(Primarily, the newsfeed system is responsible for the following two tasks:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Feed generation: The newsfeed is generated by aggregating friends’ and followers’ posts \(or) Tj
T*
(feed items\) based on some ranking mechanism.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Feed publishing: When a feed is published, the relevant data is written into the cache and) Tj
T*
(database. This data could be textual or any media content. A post containing the data from) Tj
T*
(friends and followers is populated to a user’s newsfeed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s move to the high-level design of our newsfeed system. It consists of the above two) Tj
T*
(essential parts, shown in the following figure:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([High-level design of the Newsfeed system]\(./hld.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s discuss the main components shown in the high-level design:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. User\(s\): Users can make a post with some content or request their newsfeed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Load balancer: It redirects traffic to one of the web servers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Web servers: The web servers encapsulate the back-end services and work as an intermediate) Tj
T*
(layer between users and various services. Apart from enforcing authentication and rate-) Tj
T*
(limiting, web servers are responsible to redirect traffic to other back-end services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Notification service: It informs the newsfeed generation service whenever a new post is) Tj
T*
(available from one’s friends or followers, and sends a push notification.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Newsfeed generation service: This service generates newsfeeds from the posts of) Tj
T*
(followers/friends of a user and keeps them in the newsfeed cache.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Newsfeed publishing service: This service is responsible for publishing newsfeeds to a) Tj
T*
(users’ timeline from the newsfeed cache. It also appends a thumbnail of the media content from) Tj
T*
(the blob storage and its link to the newsfeed intended for a user.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Post-service: Whenever a user requests to create a post, the post-service is called, and the) Tj
T*
(created post is stored on the post database and corresponding cache. The media content in the) Tj
T*
(post is stored in the blob storage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### API design) Tj
T*
