T*
(HTTP-based that allow clients to perform actions, including posting a status, retrieving) Tj
T*
(newsfeeds, adding friends, and so on. We aim to generate and get a user’s newsfeed; therefore,) Tj
T*
(the following APIs are essential:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
