(Answer) Tj
T*
(When a user, say Bob, creates a new post, it is stored in the post database and cache. In the) Tj
T*
(next step, the newsfeed generation service generates a newsfeed for Bob’s friends and) Tj
T*
(followers, and the newsfeed cache is updated. The updated newsfeed is delivered to the) Tj
T*
(corresponding users on the next page/screen refresh event.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
