(extracted from each post.) Tj
T*
(2. Based on Bob’s previous history, stored in the user database, the relevance is calculated) Tj
T*
(for each post via different ranking and machine learning algorithms.) Tj
T*
(3. A relevance score is assigned, say from 1 to 5, where 1 shows the least relevant post and 5) Tj
T*
(means highly relevant post.) Tj
T*
(4. The top 4 posts are selected out of 10 based on the assigned scores.) Tj
T*
(5. The top 4 posts are combined and presented on Bob’s timeline in decreasing order of the) Tj
T*
(score assigned.) Tj
