T*
() Tj
T*
(Newsfeed ranking with various machine learning and ranking algorithms is a computationally) Tj
T*
(intensive task. In our design, the ranking service ranks posts and constructs newsfeeds. This) Tj
T*
(service consists of big-data processing systems that might utilize specialized hardware like) Tj
T*
(graphics processing units \(GPUs\) and tensor processing units \(TPUs\).) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
