(storing view counts for answers, adding statistics to the database for later analysis, and so) Tj
T*
(on.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Increasing QPS on MySQL: Because we have a higher number of features offered by our system,) Tj
T*
(few MySQL tables receive a lot of user queries. This results in a higher number of QPS on) Tj
T*
(certain MySQL servers, which can result in higher latency. Furthermore, there is no scheme) Tj
T*
(defined for disaster recovery management in our design.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Latency of HBase: Even though HBase allows high real-time throughput, its P99 latency is not) Tj
T*
(among the best. A number of Quora features require the ML engine that has a latency of its own.) Tj
