(P99 stands for 99th percentile. It means that 99 percent of the queries are entertained below a) Tj
T*
(specific number. For example, P99 of 20 ms means that 99 percent of the queries will be replied) Tj
T*
(to within 20 ms by a server.) Tj
T*
