(Answer) Tj
T*
(Long polling transfers the control to the server side instead of the client, which has no) Tj
T*
(information about the updates in content. If the server is in control, it can reply as soon as) Tj
T*
(there is fresh content. As a result, it reduces the request load on itself. However, long) Tj
T*
(polling is a resource-intensive solution because it keeps the connection persistent or alive) Tj
T*
(for a longer period of time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
