T*
(- Recommendation system: The recommendation system is responsible for several features. For) Tj
T*
(example, we might need to develop a user feed, find related questions and ads, recommend) Tj
T*
(questions to potential respondents, and even highlight duplicate content and content in) Tj
T*
(violation of the service’s terms of use. Unlike the answer ranking system, the recommendation) Tj
T*
(system must provide both online and offline services. This system receives requests from the) Tj
T*
(application server and forwards selected features to the ML engine.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Search feature: Over time, as questions and answers are fed to the Quora system, it is) Tj
T*
(possible to build an index in the HBase. User search queries are matched against the index, and) Tj
T*
(related content is suggested to the user. Frequently accessed indexes can be served from cache) Tj
T*
(for low latency. The index can be constructed from questions, answers, topics labels, and) Tj
T*
(usernames. Tokenization of the search index returns the same results for reordered words also) Tj
T*
(\(see Scaling Search and Indexing in Distributed Search chapter for more details\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
