(be consistent. In particular, critical content like questions and answers should be the same) Tj
T*
(for any collection of viewers. However, it is not necessary that all users of Quora see a newly) Tj
T*
(posted question, answer, or comment right away.) Tj
T*
(- Availability: The system should have high availability. This applies to cases where servers) Tj
T*
(receive a large number of concurrent requests.) Tj
T*
(- Performance: The system should provide a smooth experience to the user without a noticeable) Tj
T*
(delay.) Tj
T*
() Tj
