(## Resource estimation) Tj
T*
(In this section, we’ll make an estimate about the resource requirements for Quora service.) Tj
T*
(We’ll make assumptions to get a practical and tractable estimate. We’ll estimate the number of) Tj
T*
(servers, the storage, and the bandwidth required to facilitate a large number of users.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Assumptions: It is important to base our estimation on some underlying assumptions. We,) Tj
T*
(therefore, assume the following:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- There are a total of 1 billion users, out of which 300 million are daily active users.) Tj
T*
(- Assume 15% of questions have an image, and 5% of questions have a video embedded in them. A) Tj
T*
(question cannot have both at the same time.) Tj
T*
(- We’ll assume an image is estimated to be 250 KBs, and a video is considered 5 MBs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Number of servers estimation) Tj
T*
(Let’s estimate our requests per second \(RPS\) for our design. If there are an average of 300) Tj
T*
(million daily active users and each user can generate 20 requests per day, then the total) Tj
T*
(number of requests in a day will be:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(300 x 10^6 x 20= 6 x 10^9) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Therefore, the RPS = 6 x 10^9/86400 = 69500 approximately requests per second.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(                    Estimating RPS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
