T*
(servers 2, 3, and 4. When the aperture rotates or moves in the given subset of arrays of the) Tj
T*
(same size, each client’s service has new servers available to create sessions. The number of) Tj
T*
(sessions established per server is shown in the figure below.) Tj
T*
