T*
(1\). It means that there is fractional overlapping concerning the ring coordinates. However,) Tj
T*
(this overlapping can lead to asymmetric sharing as well. Symmetric or asymmetric, the load) Tj
T*
(balancing can be done through P2C. For instance, in the diagram above, servers 1 and 3 will) Tj
T*
(receive half the load that server 2 gets. This means that a server can receive more or less) Tj
T*
(load, depending on its overlapped slice size with a client.) Tj
T*
() Tj
