(## Personalization) Tj
T*
(Users receive typeahead suggestions based on their previous searches, location, language, and) Tj
T*
(other factors. We can save each user’s personal history on the server separately and cache it) Tj
T*
(on the client. Before transmitting the final set to the user, the server might include these) Tj
