() Tj
T*
(## Summary) Tj
T*
(In this design problem, we learned how pushing resource-intensive processing to the offline) Tj
T*
(infrastructure and using appropriate data structures enables us to serve our customers with low) Tj
T*
(latency. Many optimizations lend themselves to specific use cases. We saw multiple) Tj
T*
(optimizations on our trie data structures for condensed data storage and quick serving.) Tj
