(## High-level design) Tj
T*
(According to our requirements, the system shouldn’t just suggest queries in real time with) Tj
T*
(minimum latency but should also store the new search queries in the database. This way, the) Tj
T*
(user gets suggestions based on popular and recent searches.) Tj
T*
() Tj
