(- Provide suggestions based on the search history of the user.) Tj
T*
(- Store all the new and trending queries in the database to include them in the list of) Tj
T*
(suggestions.) Tj
T*
(When a user starts typing a query, every typed character hits one of the application servers.) Tj
T*
(Let’s assume that we have a suggestions service that obtains the top ten suggestions from the) Tj
T*
(cache, Redis, and returns them as a response to the client. In addition to this, suppose we) Tj
T*
(have another service known as an assembler. An assembler collects the user searches, applies) Tj
T*
(some analytics to rank the searches, and stores them in a NoSQL database that’s distributed) Tj
T*
(across several nodes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([The high-level design of the typeahead suggestion system]\(./hld.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
