T*
(add application servers as entry points for clients so that they can forward requests to the) Tj
T*
(appropriate microservices. These web servers encapsulate the internal system architecture and) Tj
T*
(provide other services, such as authentication, monitoring, request shaping, management, and) Tj
T*
(more.) Tj
T*
() Tj
