(### Bandwidth estimation) Tj
T*
(3.5 billion queries will reach our system every day. Assume that each query a user types is 15) Tj
T*
(characters long on average.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Keeping this in mind, the total number of reading requests of characters per day would be as) Tj
T*
(follows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(15×3.5 billion=52.5 characters per day.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Total read requests per second: 52.5B/86400≈0.607M characters/sec. 86,400 is the number of) Tj
T*
(seconds per day.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Since each character takes 2 Bytes, the bandwidth our system would need is as follows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(0.607M×2×8=9.7Mb/sec) Tj
T*
() Tj
