(9.7Mb/sec is the incoming bandwidth requirement for queries that have a maximum length of 15) Tj
T*
(characters. Our system would suggest the top ten queries that are roughly of the same length as) Tj
T*
(the query length after each character a user types. Therefore, the outgoing bandwidth) Tj
T*
(requirement would become the following: 15×10×9.7Mb/sec=1.46Gb/sec.) Tj
T*
() Tj
