([The total bandwidth required by the typeahead suggestion system]\(./bandwidth.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Number of servers estimation) Tj
T*
(Our system will receive 607,000 requests per second concurrently. Therefore, we need to have) Tj
T*
(many servers installed to avoid burdening a single server. Let’s assume that a single server) Tj
T*
(can handle 8,000 queries per second. So, we require around 76 servers to handle 607,000) Tj
T*
(queries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
