(## Design Typeahead Suggestion/System Design The Typeahead Suggestion System/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# System Design: The Typeahead Suggestion System) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Introduction) Tj
T*
(Typeahead suggestion, also referred to as the autocomplete feature, enables users to search for) Tj
T*
(a known and frequently searched query. This feature comes into play when a user types a query) Tj
T*
(in the search box. The typeahead system provides a list of suggestions to complete a query) Tj
T*
(based on the user’s search history, the current context of the search, and trending content) Tj
T*
(across different users and regions. Frequently searched queries always appear at the top of the) Tj
T*
(suggestion list. The typeahead system doesn’t make the search faster. However, it helps the) Tj
T*
(user form a sentence more quickly. It’s an essential part of all search engines that enhances) Tj
T*
(the user experience.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([The typeahead suggestion system in action]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How will we design a typeahead suggestion system?) Tj
T*
(We’ve divided the chapter on the design of the typeahead suggestion system into six lessons:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Requirements: In this lesson, we focus on the functional and non-functional requirements for) Tj
T*
(designing a typeahead suggestion system. We also discuss resource estimations for the smooth) Tj
T*
(operation of the system.) Tj
T*
(2. High-level design: In this lesson, we discuss the high-level design of our version of the) Tj
T*
(typeahead suggestion system. We also discuss some essential APIs used in the design.) Tj
T*
(3. Data Structure for Storing Prefixes: In this lesson, we cover an efficient tree data) Tj
T*
(structure called trie that’s used to store search prefixes. We also discuss how it can be) Tj
T*
(further optimized to reduce the tree traversal time.) Tj
T*
(4. Detailed design: In this lesson, we explain the two main components, the suggestions service) Tj
T*
(and the assembler, which make up the detailed design of the typeahead suggestion system.) Tj
T*
(5. Evaluation: This lesson evaluates the proposed design of the typeahead suggestion system) Tj
T*
(based on the non-functional requirements of the system. It also presents some client-side) Tj
T*
(optimization and personalization that could significantly affect the system’s design.) Tj
T*
(6. Quiz: In this lesson, we assess our understanding of the design via a quiz.) Tj
T*
(Let’s start by identifying the requirements for designing a typeahead suggestion system.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
