(## Design Uber/Payment Service and Fraud Detection in Uber Design/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Payment Service and Fraud Detection in Uber Design) Tj
T*
(Our goal in this lesson is to highlight the need to secure the system against malicious) Tj
T*
(activities. We’ll discuss fraudulent activities in the context of payment. We’ll first briefly) Tj
T*
(go through how the payment system works, and then we’ll cover how to guard our system against) Tj
T*
(malicious activity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The payment service deals with the payments side of the Uber application. It includes) Tj
T*
(collecting payment from the rider to give it to the driver. As the trip completes, it collects) Tj
T*
(the trip information, calculates the cost of the journey, and initiates the payment process.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Major functionality) Tj
T*
(The Uber payments platform includes the following functionality:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- New payment options: It adds new payment options for users.) Tj
T*
(- Authorization: It authorizes the payments for transactions.) Tj
T*
(- Refund: It refunds a payment that was authorized before.) Tj
T*
(- Charging: It moves money from a user account to Uber.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(In a payment service, authorization is a process to verify the payment method—for example,) Tj
T*
(whether a certain credit card is valid or not.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(## What to prevent) Tj
T*
(We need to prevent the following scenarios for the success of the payment system:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Lack of payment) Tj
T*
(- Duplicate payments) Tj
T*
(- Incorrect payment) Tj
T*
(- Incorrect currency conversion) Tj
T*
(- Dangling authorization) Tj
T*
(The Uber payment platform is based on the double-entry bookkeeping method.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(Double-entry bookkeeping, also known as, double-entry accounting, is a method of bookkeeping) Tj
T*
(that relies on a two-sided accounting entry to maintain financial information. Every entry to) Tj
T*
(an account requires a corresponding and opposite entry to a different account. Source:) Tj
T*
(Wikipedia) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
