T*
(Bandwidth for each trip \(Bytes\)                       100) Tj
T*
(Total bandwidth for trips \(kilo bits per second\)      185.6) Tj
T*
(Active drivers \(millions\)                               3) Tj
T*
(Bandwidth for each driver \(Bytes\)                      19) Tj
T*
(Bandwidth for drivers \(Megabits per second\)            114) Tj
T*
(Total bandwidth \(Megabits per second\)                  114.19) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
