(## Building blocks we will use) Tj
T*
(The design of Uber utilizes the following building blocks:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Building blocks in high-level design of Uber]\(./bb.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Databases store the metadata of riders, drivers, and trips.) Tj
T*
(- A cache stores the most requested data for quick responses.) Tj
T*
(- CDNs are used to effectively deliver content to end users, reducing delay and the burden on) Tj
T*
(end-servers.) Tj
T*
(- A load balancer distributes the read/write requests among the respective services.) Tj
T*
(- Riders’ and drivers’ devices should have sufficient bandwidth and GPS equipment for smooth) Tj
T*
(navigation with maps.) Tj
T*
