(## Design Uber/System Design Uber/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# System Design: Uber) Tj
T*
(## What is Uber?) Tj
T*
(Uber is an application that provides ride-hailing services to its users. Anyone who needs a) Tj
T*
(ride can register and book a vehicle to travel from source to destination. Anyone who has a) Tj
T*
(vehicle can register as a driver and take riders to their destination. Drivers and riders can) Tj
T*
(communicate through the Uber app on their smartphones.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Uber]\(./uber\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
