(## How will we design Uber?) Tj
T*
(There are many unanswered questions regarding Uber. How does it work? How do drivers connect) Tj
T*
(with riders? These are only two of many. This chapter will design a system like Uber and find) Tj
T*
(the answer to such questions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We’ve divided the design of Uber into six sections:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Requirements: This lesson will describe the functional and non-functional requirements of a) Tj
T*
(system like Uber. We’ll also estimate the requirements of multiple aspects of Uber, such as) Tj
T*
(storage, bandwidth, and the computation resources.) Tj
T*
(2. High-level Design: We’ll discuss the high-level design of Uber in this lesson. In addition,) Tj
T*
(we’ll also briefly explain the API design of the Uber service.) Tj
T*
(3. Detailed Design: We’ll explore the detailed design of Uber in this lesson. Moreover, we will) Tj
T*
(also discuss the working of different components used in designing Uber.) Tj
