(### Number of servers estimation) Tj
T*
(WhatsApp handles around 10 million connections on a single server, which seems quite high for a) Tj
T*
(server. However, it’s possible by extensive performance engineering. We’ll need to know all the) Tj
T*
(in-depth details of a system, such as a server’s kernel, networking library, infrastructure) Tj
T*
(configuration, and so on.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(Note: We can often optimize a general-purpose server for special tasks by careful performance) Tj
T*
(engineering of the full software stack.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(Let’s move to the estimation of the number of servers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
