(Let’s understand how the per-segment encoding will work. For any video with dynamic colors and) Tj
T*
(high depth, we’ll encode it differently from a video with fewer colors. This means that a not-) Tj
T*
(so-dynamic segment will be encoded such that it’s compressed more to save additional storage) Tj
T*
(space. Eventually, we’ll have to transfer smaller file sizes and save bandwidth during the) Tj
T*
(deployment and streaming phases.) Tj
T*
() Tj
