(Using the strategy above, we’ll have to encode individual shots of a video in various formats.) Tj
T*
(However, the alternative to this would be storing an entire video \(using no segmenting\) after) Tj
T*
(encoding it in various formats. If we encode on a per-shot basis, we would be able to optimally) Tj
T*
(reduce the size of the entire video by doing the encoding on a granular level. We can also) Tj
T*
(encode audio in various formats to optimally allow streaming for various clients like TVs,) Tj
T*
(mobile phones, and desktop machines. Specifically, for services like Netflix, audio encoding is) Tj
T*
(more useful because audios are offered in various languages.) Tj
T*
