(times. Since the video is divided into chunks of different qualities, each of the same time) Tj
T*
(frame, the chunks are provided to clients based on changing network conditions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(As shown below, when the bandwidth is high, a higher quality chunk is sent to the client and) Tj
T*
(vice versa.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Chunk size in each time frame provided to the client changes according to the) Tj
T*
(bandwidth]\(./adaptive_streaming.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The adaptive bitrate algorithm depends on the following four parameters:) Tj
T*
() Tj
