T*
(## Finalized design) Tj
T*
(We added a few new components to our design. We introduced caches to store popular places. This) Tj
T*
(allows us to fetch the places much faster. Moreover, we also added a rating calculator that) Tj
T*
(sorts the places based on their ratings. This will enhance user experience, since the places) Tj
T*
(with a good rating will be displayed first.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The updated design of our system is shown below:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Updated Yelp design]\(./updated_design.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Evaluation) Tj
T*
(Let’s see how our system design fulfills our requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Availability: We partitioned the data into smaller segments instead of having to deal with a) Tj
T*
(huge dataset consisting of all the places on the world map. This made our system highly) Tj
T*
(available. We also replicated the QuadTrees data using key-value stores to ensure availability.) Tj
T*
(- Scalability: We split the whole world into smaller dynamic segments. This allows us to search) Tj
T*
(for a place within a specific radius and shorten our search area. We then used QuadTrees in) Tj
T*
(which each child node holds a single segment. Upon adding or removing a place, we can) Tj
T*
(restructure our QuadTrees. So, we were able to make our system scalable.) Tj
T*
(- Performance: We reduced the latency by using caches. We cached all the famous and popular) Tj
T*
(places, so request time was minimized.) Tj
T*
(- Consistency: The users have a consistent view of the data regarding places, reviews, and) Tj
T*
(photos because we used reliable and fault-tolerant databases like key-value stores and) Tj
T*
(relational databases.) Tj
T*
(## Summary) Tj
T*
(The proximity-based servers allow the user to search for a specific place or places nearby. The) Tj
T*
(map data of the world is huge and dividing it into segments and finding the specific segment) Tj
T*
(was a challenge in itself. So, we used QuadTrees to optimize our search and provided the user) Tj
T*
(with a list of places with minimum latency.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Design a Proximity Service Yelp/Design of Yelp/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
