(## Storage schema) Tj
T*
(Let’s define the storage schema for our system. A few of the tables we might need are “Place,”) Tj
T*
(“Photos,” “Reviews,” and “Users.”) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s define the columns of the “Place” table:) Tj
T*
() Tj
