T*
(Bytes\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Latitude: This stores the latitude of the location \(8 Bytes\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Longitude: This stores the longitude of the location \(8 Bytes\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Photos: This contains the foreign key \(8 Bytes\) of another table “Photos,” which contains all) Tj
T*
(the photos related to a particular place.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Rating: This stores the rating of the place. It shows how many stars a place gets out of) Tj
T*
(five. The rating is calculated based on the reviews it gets from the users.) Tj
T*
() Tj
