(## Design a Proximity Service Yelp/System Design Yelp/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# System Design: Yelp) Tj
T*
(## What is Yelp?) Tj
T*
(Yelp is a one-stop platform for consumers to discover, connect, and transact with local) Tj
T*
(businesses. With it, users can join a waitlist, make a reservation, schedule an appointment, or) Tj
T*
(purchase goods easily. Yelp also provides information, photos, and reviews about local) Tj
T*
(businesses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The user provides the name of a place or its GPS location, and the system finds places that are) Tj
T*
(nearby. The user can also upload their opinions on this platform in the form of text, pictures,) Tj
T*
(or ratings for a place they visited. Other location-based services include Foursquare and) Tj
T*
(Google Nearby.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Services based on proximity servers are helpful in finding nearby attractions such as) Tj
T*
(restaurants, theaters, or recreational sites. Designing such a system is challenging because we) Tj
T*
(have to efficiently find all the possible places in a given radius with minimum latency. This) Tj
T*
(means that we have to narrow down all the locations in the world, which could be in the) Tj
T*
(billions, and only pinpoint the relevant ones.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([Yelp]\(./yelp\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How will we design Yelp?) Tj
T*
(Here is the breakdown of Yelp’s design:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1。Requirements: In this lesson, we define the requirements and estimate the required servers,) Tj
T*
(storage, and bandwidth of our system.) Tj
T*
(2。Design:In this lesson, we define the API design, the database schema, the components of our) Tj
T*
(system, and the workflow of Yelp.) Tj
T*
(3。Design considerations: In this lesson, we dive deep into the design of the Yelp system.) Tj
T*
(4。Quiz: In this lesson, we take a quiz to test our knowledge of Yelp design.) Tj
T*
(Let’s start our design by defining its requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Design a URL Shortening Service TinyURL/Design and Deployment of TinyURL/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Design and Deployment of TinyURL) Tj
T*
