(## Design) Tj
T*
(Let’s discuss the main design components required for our URL shortening service. Our design) Tj
T*
(depends on each part’s functionality and progressively combines them to achieve different) Tj
T*
(workflows mentioned in the functional requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Components) Tj
T*
(We’ll explain the inner mechanism of different components within our system, as well as their) Tj
T*
(usage as a part of the whole system below. We’ll also highlight the design choices made for) Tj
T*
(each component to achieve the overall functionality.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Database: For services like URL shortening, there isn’t a lot of data to store. However, the) Tj
T*
(storage has to be horizontally scalable. The type of data we need to store includes:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- User details.) Tj
T*
