() Tj
T*
(- Distinguishable characters like 0 \(zero\), O \(capital o\), I \(capital i\), and l \(lower case L\)) Tj
T*
(are eliminated, excluding the possibility of mistaking a character for another look-alike) Tj
T*
(character.) Tj
