(- Non-alphanumeric characters like + \(plus\) and / \(slash\) are also eliminated to only have) Tj
T*
(alphanumeric characters in short URLs. Second, it also helps avoid other system-dependent) Tj
T*
(encodings and makes the URLs readily available for all modern file systems and URLs schemes.) Tj
T*
(Such characters may lead to undesired behavior and output during parsing.) Tj
T*
(This non-functional requirement enhances the user interactivity of our system and makes short) Tj
