(## Distributed Messaging Queue/Design of a Distributed Messaging Queue Part 1/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Design of a Distributed Messaging Queue: Part 1) Tj
T*
(So far, we’ve discussed the requirements and design considerations of a distributed messaging) Tj
T*
(queue. Now, let’s begin with learning about the high-level design of a distributed messaging) Tj
T*
(queue.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Distributed messaging queue) Tj
T*
(Unlike a single-server messaging queue, a distributed messaging queue resides on multiple) Tj
T*
(servers. A distributed messaging queue has its own challenges. However, it resolves the) Tj
T*
(drawbacks of a single-server messaging queue if designed properly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The following sections focus on the scalability, availability, and durability issues of) Tj
T*
(designing a distributed messaging queue by introducing us to a more fault-tolerant architecture) Tj
T*
