(### Primary-secondary model) Tj
T*
(In the primary-secondary model, each node is considered a primary host for a collection of) Tj
T*
(queues. The responsibility of a primary host is to receive requests for a particular queue and) Tj
T*
(be fully responsible for data replication. The request is received by the frontend, which in) Tj
T*
(turn communicates with the metadata service to determine the primary host for the request.) Tj
T*
() Tj
