T*
(In asynchronous replication, once the primary host receives the messages, it acknowledges the) Tj
T*
(client, and in the next step, it starts replicating the message in other hosts. This approach) Tj
T*
(comes with other problems such as replication lag and consistency issues.) Tj
T*
() Tj
