(drawbacks in this lesson.) Tj
T*
(2. Design consideration: In this lesson, we discuss some important factors that may affect the) Tj
T*
(design of a distributed messaging queue—for example, the order of placing messages in a queue,) Tj
T*
(their extraction, their visibility in the queue, and the concurrency of incoming messages.) Tj
T*
(3. Design: In this lesson, we discuss the design of a distributed messaging queue in detail. We) Tj
T*
(also describe the process of replication of queues and the interaction between various building) Tj
T*
(blocks involved in the design.) Tj
