(There are fault-tolerant system designs that hide most of the failures from the end users, but) Tj
T*
(it’s crucial to catch the failures before they snowball into a bigger problem. The unplanned) Tj
T*
(outage in services can be costly. For example, in October 2021, Meta’s applications were down) Tj
T*
(for nearly nine hours, resulting in a loss of around $13 million per hour. Such losses) Tj
T*
(emphasize the potential impact of outages.) Tj
