(could take us a lot of time and effort to debug the system manually. Moreover, for larger) Tj
T*
(services, we need to ensure that our services are working within our agreed service-level) Tj
T*
(agreements. We need to catch important trends and signals of impending failures as early) Tj
T*
(warnings so that any concerns or issues can be addressed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Monitoring helps in analyzing such complex infrastructure where something is constantly) Tj
T*
(failing. Monitoring distributed systems entails gathering, interpreting, and displaying data) Tj
T*
(about the interactions between processes that are running at the same time. It assists in) Tj
T*
(debugging, testing, performance evaluation, and having a bird’s-eye view over multiple) Tj
T*
(services.) Tj
T*
(## How will we design a distributed monitoring system?) Tj
T*
(We’ve divided the distributed monitoring system design into the following chapters and lessons:) Tj
T*
() Tj
