(these replicas.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Indexing with replicas**) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(From the diagram above, we assume that each partition is forwarded to each replica for index) Tj
T*
(computation. Let’s look at the example where we want to index partition P_1. This means that) Tj
T*
(the same partition will be forwarded to all three replicas in both availability zones.) Tj
