(node fails.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Searching with replicas) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We have three copies of each partition’s index. The load balancer chooses one of the three) Tj
T*
(copies of each partition to perform the query. An increased number of copies improves the) Tj
T*
(scalability and availability of the system. Now, the system can handle three times more queries) Tj
T*
(in the same amount of time.) Tj
