T*
(## Summary) Tj
T*
(In this lesson, we have resolved two key problems of scalability \(due to colocated indexing and) Tj
T*
(searching\) and resource wastage \(due to index recomputation\) by using dedicated nodes for) Tj
T*
(indexing and searching. Both operations rely on distributed storage. Furthermore, we presented) Tj
