(the details of the indexing and searching process.) Tj
T*
(4. Final design: In this lesson, we evaluate our previous design and revamp it to make it more) Tj
T*
(scalable.) Tj
T*
(5. Evaluation: This lesson explains how our designed distributed search system fulfills its) Tj
