T*
(- Dependency: Broadly, tasks can be of two types: dependent and independent.) Tj
T*
(  - Dependent tasks require executing one or more additional tasks for their complete) Tj
T*
(execution. These tasks must run in a sequence. For a dependent task, the client should provide) Tj
T*
(a list of the tasks on which a given task is dependent.) Tj
