(just push those tasks that are ready for execution shortly to the queue. The tasks that are) Tj
T*
(successfully executed need to be removed from the queue. Moreover, there are different) Tj
T*
(scheduling types. A task could be scheduled once, daily, weekly, monthly, or annually.) Tj
T*
(Therefore, we have to save the task somewhere in our storage.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
