T*
(There is a cluster manager to which each node sends a heartbeat that indicates the node is) Tj
T*
(working correctly. Each node updates the cluster manager about the admitted tasks. The cluster) Tj
T*
(manager maintains a list of tasks and the node ID that admitted that task. In case a node fails) Tj
T*
(to execute a task, the cluster manager hands over that task to another node in the cluster. The) Tj
