(Question) Tj
T*
(How are DNS names processed? For example, will educative.io be processed from left to right or) Tj
T*
(right to left?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Answer) Tj
T*
(Unlike UNIX files, which are processed from left to right, DNS names are processed from right) Tj
T*
(to left. In the case of educative.io, the resolvers will first resolve the .io part, then) Tj
T*
(educative, and so on.) Tj
T*
() Tj
