(### Modify the API design) Tj
T*
(We talked about how we can decide if two events are causally related or not using a vector) Tj
T*
(clock value. For this, we need information about which node performed the operation before and) Tj
T*
(what its vector clock value was. This is the context of an operation. So, we’ll modify our API) Tj
T*
(design as follows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The API call to get a value should look like this:) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(get\(key\)) Tj
T*
