(To update an object in the key-value store, the client must give the context. We determine) Tj
T*
(version information using a vector clock by supplying the context from a previous read) Tj
T*
(operation. If the key-value store has access to several branches, it provides all objects at) Tj
T*
(the leaf nodes, together with their respective version information in context, when processing) Tj
T*
(a read request. Reconciling disparate versions and merging them into a single new version is) Tj
T*
(considered an update.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
