(### Vector clock usage example) Tj
T*
(Let’s consider an example. Say we have a write operation request. Node A handles the first) Tj
T*
(version of the write request, E1. The corresponding vector clock has node information and its) Tj
T*
(counter—that is, [A,1]. Node A handles another write for the same object on which the previous) Tj
T*
(write was performed. So, for E2, we have [A,2]. E1 is no longer required because E2 was updated) Tj
T*
(on the same node. E2 reads the changes made by E1, and then new changes are made. Suppose a) Tj
