T*
(and \([A,2], [C,1]\), are now in the system.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Suppose the network partition is repaired, and the client requests a write again, but now we) Tj
T*
(have conflicts. The context \( [A,3], [B,1], [C,1] \) of the conflicts are returned to the) Tj
