(Blob storage: We’ll use blob storage to store our information about metrics.) Tj
T*
(## High-level design) Tj
T*
(The high-level components of our monitoring service are the following:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Storage: A time-series database stores metrics data, such as the current CPU use or the) Tj
T*
(number of exceptions in an application.) Tj
T*
() Tj
