([Adding the service discoverer]\(./discoverer.jpg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Querying service) Tj
T*
(We want a service to access the database and fetch the relevant query results. We need this) Tj
T*
(because we want to view the errors like values of a particular node’s memory usage, or send an) Tj
T*
(alert if a metric exceeds the set limit. Let’s add the two components we need along with) Tj
T*
(querying.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Alert Manager) Tj
T*
(The alert manager is responsible for sending alerts upon violations of set rules. It can send) Tj
T*
(alerts as an email, a Slack message, and so on.) Tj
