(### Dashboard) Tj
T*
(We can set dashboards by using the collected metrics to display the required information—for) Tj
T*
(example, the number of requests in the current week.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s add the components discussed above, which completes our design of the monitoring system.) Tj
T*
() Tj
