(Mathematically, A is a function of R. This means that the value of R can change independently,) Tj
T*
(and the value of A depends on R. Therefore, it’s possible to have situations where we have:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(low A, low R) Tj
T*
(low A, high R) Tj
T*
(high A, low R) Tj
T*
(high A, high R \(desirable\)) Tj
