(• Time stamp: 41 bits are assigned for milliseconds. The Twitter Snowflake default epoch will) Tj
T*
(be used. Its value is 1288834974657, which is equivalent to November 4, 2010, 01:42:54 UTC. We) Tj
T*
(can initiate our own epoch when our system will be deployed, say January 1, 2022, at 12) Tj
T*
(midnight can be the start of our epoch from zero. The maximum time to deplete this range is) Tj
T*
(shown below:) Tj
T*
() Tj
