(Time to range depletion = 2^41 identifiers / 365\(days/year\) x 24 \(hours/day\) x 60) Tj
T*
(\(mininutes/hour\) x 60 \(secondes/minutes\) x 1000 \(identifiers/sec\) = approximately 69 years) Tj
T*
() Tj
