() Tj
T*
(We can use an appropriate data store to keep our metadata, which includes counter identifiers,) Tj
T*
(their number of shards, and the mapping of shards to physical machines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s consider Twitter as an example to understand how an application uses the above API. The) Tj
T*
