(## Spectacular Failures/Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Oculus Outage/README.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Oculus Outage) Tj
T*
(In October 2021, Facebook experienced a global outage for about six hours, affecting its other) Tj
T*
(affiliates, including Messenger, WhatsApp, Mapillary, Instagram, and Oculus. Popular media) Tj
T*
(reported the impact of this failure prominently. The New York Times reported the following) Tj
T*
(headline: “Gone in Minutes, Out for Hours: Outage Shakes Facebook.”) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(According to one estimate, this outage cost Facebook about $100 million in revenue losses and) Tj
T*
(many billions due to the declining stock of the company.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Let’s look at the sequence of events that caused this global problem.) Tj
T*
(## The sequence of events) Tj
T*
(The following sequence of events led to the outage of Facebook and its accompanied services:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A routine maintenance system was needed to find out the spare capacity on Facebook’s backbone) Tj
T*
(network.) Tj
T*
(Due to a configuration error, the maintenance system disconnected all the data centers from) Tj
T*
(each other on the backbone network. Earlier, an automated configuration review tool was used to) Tj
T*
(look for any issues in the configuration, but tools like these aren’t perfect. In this specific) Tj
T*
(case, the review tool missed the problems present in a configuration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The authoritative domain name systems \(DNSs\) of Facebook had a health check rule that if it) Tj
T*
(couldn’t reach Facebook’s internal data centers, it would stop replying to client DNS queries) Tj
T*
(by withdrawing the routes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(When the networks routes where Facebook’s authoritative DNS was hosted were withdrawn, all) Tj
T*
(cached mapping of human-readable names to IPs soon timed out at all public DNS resolvers. When) Tj
T*
(a client resolves www.facebook.com, the DNS resolver first goes to one of the root DNS servers,) Tj
T*
(which provides a list of authoritative DNS servers for .com. The resolver connects to one of) Tj
T*
(them, and then they provide IPs for the authoritative DNS servers for Facebook. However, after) Tj
T*
(route withdrawal, it was impossible to reach them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Then, no one was able to reach Facebook and its subsidiaries.) Tj
T*
(The slides below depict the events in pictorial form.) Tj
T*
