(it might reveal internal service details. So, there can be a trade-off between business and) Tj
T*
(robustness needs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Trade-offs: There can be some surprising trade-offs. An example here is the need for data) Tj
T*
(security and the need for rapid manual repair. Because so many physical and digital safeguards) Tj
T*
(were in place, manual intervention was slow. This is a catch-22 situation—lowering security) Tj
