(### Scheduling) Tj
T*
(As was established previously, we may need to recrawl URLs on various frequencies. These) Tj
T*
(frequencies are determined by the application of the URL.We can determine the frequency of) Tj
T*
(recrawl in two different ways:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. We can assign a default or a specific recrawling frequency to each URL. This assignment) Tj
T*
(depends on the application of the URL defining the priority. A default frequency is assigned to) Tj
T*
(the standard-priority URLs and a higher recrawl frequency is given to the higher-priority URLs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Based on each URL’s associated recrawl frequency, we can decide to enqueue URLs in the priority) Tj
T*
(queue from the scheduler’s database. The priority defines the place of a URL in the queue.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. The second method is to have separate queues for various priority URLs, use URLs from high-) Tj
T*
(priority queues first, and subsequently move to the lower-priority URLs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
