(## Conclusion) Tj
T*
(The web crawler system entails a multi-worker design that uses a microservices architecture.) Tj
T*
(Besides achieving the basic crawling functionality, our design provides insights into the) Tj
T*
(potential shortcomings and challenges associated with our design and further rectifies them) Tj
T*
(with appropriate design modifications. The noteworthy features of our design are as follows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Identification and design modification for crawler traps) Tj
T*
(2. Extensibility of HTML fetching and content extraction modules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## System Design Web Crawler/Requirements of a Web Crawler's Design/README.md) Tj
